  "description": "Generic JobSchedule queue consumer for WA.Core: a single BackgroundService (JobService) that polls prc_JobSchedule_GetReadyToBeRun and dispatches each due row to whichever registered IJobHandler's JobName matches -- one-shot (prc_JobSchedule_MarkAsFinished) or, when a handler declares IJobHandler.RecurrenceIntervalSeconds, self-recurring through the same row (prc_JobSchedule_ScheduleNextExecution). PostgreSQL support added (Npgsql provider) alongside SQL Server.",
