  "releaseNotes": "2.0.0 (BREAKING, major release for nuget.org): PostgreSQL support added across WA.Core -- the same config XML / SQL now runs on SQL Server or PostgreSQL (Npgsql). All SI.WA.* packages moved to a new major version together; reference them with matching versions. Runs against SQL Server or PostgreSQL through DataBridge.",
